  cutscenes:
  - cutsceneID: 1
    entries:
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a32bf576bf2347488d3ee8f828af409, type: 3}
      text: It was just another summer right before my college.
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b709f881b7b76843906a929f4c0e640, type: 3}
      text: I was hiking on the montain to spend some time alone.
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 475d4b0ef41697e40b7caffd03c7b02d, type: 3}
      text: Until i was not.
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d12d114c53447e44098f4236c574fa7a, type: 3}
      text: 
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 003c3c00eb7866044a9bd76cc401c312, type: 3}
      text: 
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76bab4324d4f40b41b25b1349a87927e, type: 3}
      text: 
  - cutsceneID: 2
    entries:
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e0d474e33e29e94cb9f94b0dd9e1847, type: 3}
      text: '*pant* *pant*'
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c3be0b202995c1c4b9712c8fd975badc, type: 3}
      text: What was that?
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6f4a23d602b27e14789d26cf82dec756, type: 3}
      text: 
  - cutsceneID: Game won
    entries:
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8911cd36df87e354ea9962026ddedfa6, type: 3}
      text: "\u2014hello? \u2026anyone th\u2014 \u2026to anyone listen\u2026 we\u2026
        we still have h\u2013hope. "
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 74e470bcdc1217645ab4af4adc06e3f9, type: 3}
      text: "We f\u2026found a c\u2013cure. But \u2026don\u2019t think we\u2019ll\u2026
        survive much l\u2014. Runn\u2026 running out of food\u2026 supplies\u2026"
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4a1b243696fc7714eac2fdb0769f93d0, type: 3}
      text: "We\u2019ll\u2026 send you co\u2013ordinates\u2026 if you can hear\u2014"
  - cutsceneID: Game over
    entries:
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: da8cbd6076f713d4da0b1484b702e013, type: 3}
      text: Their journey ended here, beneath the weight of a merciless world. But
        the nightmare rages on.
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fc4e73c747968a04a99803c150cfb95f, type: 3}
      text: Awaiting the next desperate soul.
    - image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0c8c4c544014aa64fa4760493c5814a8, type: 3}
      text: The story of survival never truly ends.
